@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title UML state — quest occurrence (R4 proposal)
[*] --> Assigned : validated AI candidate
Assigned --> Active : window starts
Assigned --> Cancelled : invalid assignment / schedule revision
Active --> Completed : accepted evidence of completion
Active --> Paused : illness / rest policy
Paused --> Active : resume within valid window
Paused --> Excused : window ends during valid pause
Active --> NoData : deadline, no reliable outcome
Active --> Skipped : explicit accepted non-completion
NoData --> Completed : late evidence
NoData --> Skipped : explicit clarification
Skipped --> Completed : corrected evidence, compensate prior effect
Completed --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
Excused --> [*]
note right of NoData
NoData is not failure.
No penalty for technical failure.
Rewards / decay follow BR-06 baseline.
end note
@enduml
